# CraftSpec Windsurf Rules
- Strictly follow "The Floor" design rules: No transition: all, only animate transform and opacity.
- Anti-slop: No purple-to-blue gradients, no cards inside cards, no emoji icons.
- No invented numbers, metrics, or fake testimonials.
- Mobile touch targets must be at least 44x44px.
- Use tokens for colors and fonts. Every interactive element must have :focus-visible.
